  "abstract": "Extends MoOsc by making the per-factor mixture-of-oscillators gating depend on prediction step t (learned per-t logits) in addition to mean/velocity context. Produces per-(b,t,k) dynamics inside scan. Retains residual copy, temporal/horizon gating, curvature loss, and V-orthogonality (\u03bb=1e-5).",
